{"body":[{"tweet_id":"2087391396365996238","text":"ウジの多くは壊死した（腐った）肉のみを食べるのですが、この「新世界ラセンウジバエ」のウジは正常な（生きた）肉も食い荒らします。\n体内に深く潜り込んで内臓まで食い荒らすため、寄生された動物は酷く衰弱します。\n人への寄生例もあり、死亡例も報告されています。\n極めて危険なハエです。 https://t.co/Ijp3xEpEfv","username":"BanziroG","tweet_url":"https://twitter.com/BanziroG/status/2087391396365996238","first_link":"https://twitter.com/nikkei/status/2087094634015011318","created_at":"August 12, 2026 at 01:11PM","liked_at":"2026-08-12T09:36:21.741021","source":"ifttt","private":false,"notfound":false,"react_tweet_data":{"__typename":"Tweet","favorite_count":45304,"lang":"ja","created_at":"2026-08-12T04:11:05.000Z","display_text_range":[0,138],"entities":{},"id_str":"2087391396365996238","text":"ウジの多くは壊死した（腐った）肉のみを食べるのですが、この「新世界ラセンウジバエ」のウジは正常な（生きた）肉も食い荒らします。\n体内に深く潜り込んで内臓まで食い荒らすため、寄生された動物は酷く衰弱します。\n人への寄生例もあり、死亡例も報告されています。\n極めて危険なハエです。","user":{"id_str":"1221430552680529920","name":"🍹グァバちゃん","screen_name":"BanziroG","is_blue_verified":true,"profile_image_shape":"Circle","verified":false,"profile_image_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2025214716902342660/paQ7dkMq_normal.jpg"},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2087391396365996238"],"editable_until_msecs":"1786511465000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":false},"conversation_count":54,"news_action_type":"conversation","quoted_tweet":{"favorite_count":3135,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":767,"created_at":"2026-08-11T08:31:51.000Z","display_text_range":[0,150],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"indices":[143,150],"text":"読まれた記事"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"nikkei.com/article/DGXZQO…","expanded_url":"https://www.nikkei.com/article/DGXZQOGN203V20Q6A420C2000000/?n_cid=SNSTW005&n_tw=1786029102","indices":[28,51],"url":"https://t.co/S0oK1N4sMg"}]},"id_str":"2087094634015011318","text":"肉食バエ、幼虫が動物の臓器食い荒らす　アメリカ入境阻め\nhttps://t.co/S0oK1N4sMg\n\n新世界ラセンウジバエ。テキサスA&amp;M大学のソニア・スワイガー教授は「幼虫たちが動物の体を食べ、重要な臓器の損傷などで死に至らすこともある」と説明します。\n\n2026年5月 #読まれた記事","user":{"id_str":"169480493","n